    "decalNote": "Decals were culled per frame by their centre (160 px padding), so a long tire rut whose centre sat beyond the padding popped in at the screen edge. The bake culls against the enlarged bake view, so such ruts are now present at the edge instead of popping in (up to about 3,700 px of one rut in one frame of the in-page A/B). This is the only visible difference, and it removes an edge pop-in."
  },
